sentences.text:
In view of the findings on Issue no.1, the petitioner/s are granted the following reliefs: -
i) fair market value @ Rs.18,65,500/- per acre for the acquired land as per revised statement u/s 19 of the LA Act;
ii) additional amount @ 12% per annum on the fair market value u/s 23 (1A) of the LA Act , from the date of notification u/s 4 of the LA Act till the date of award or dispossession, whichever is earlier ;
iii) solatium u/s 23 (2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of market value ;
iv) interest under Section 28 of L.A Act @ 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per annum LAC no. 144/22 Pages 8 of 9 on the difference between the enhanced compensation awarded by this court and the Naresh Kumar vs U.O.I on 3 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/158881731/
4 compensation awarded by the LAC for the subsequent period till its payment;

